e":30777496,"digest":"sha256:6890bbcdf9bce7eb68964ef88ebfc3c6069861129240a7df4f19af4147c340a6","download_count":1179,"created_at":"2026-10-19T18:57:50Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T18:57:52Z"},{"id":657248685,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4nLNGt","name":"DBX_0.6.49_x64-win7-server2012r2-offline-setup.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdownload","state":"uploaded","size":184590352,"digest":"sha256:3c16b7dd1ef70de3df4ce7b7a76dcd936238d1d1459e28f0c7ca51764cbd1277","download_count":28,"created_at":"2026-10-19T19:43:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T19:43:45Z"},{"id":657248690,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4nLNGy","name":"DBX_0.6.49_x64-win7-server2012r2-offline-setup.exe.sha256","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":118,"digest":"sha256:53783cb5e5ceb563fe6431bac8650875bc7cba0291e3164e90b6df72de5ea71d","download_count":9,"created_at":"2026-10-19T19:43:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T19:43:35Z"},{"id":657194294,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4nK_02","name":"DBX_0.6.49_x64.dmg","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":44929842,"digest":"sha256:6ec11bc8e05c0687501a1a3f13b93474f30994bbf9224406527dee101c37c944","download_count":72,"created_at":"2026-10-19T19:19:41Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T19:19:43Z"},{"id":657146400,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4nK0Ig","name":"DBX_0.6.49_x64_en-US.msi","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":40075264,"digest":"sha256:86c15f5dc98b7bb317b120d9ab36a39a20b8366a493e8db8f5cf64a64a589c1a","download_count":62,"created_at":"2026-10-19T18:57:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T18:57:50Z"},{"id":657194453,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4nK_3V","name":"DBX_x64.app.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":44903070,"digest":"sha256:2b4897460e97b6ebba314693f82d5480763adbf1be782867f28b00538e3c5ffa","download_count":80,"created_at":"2026-10-19T19:19:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T19:19:46Z"},{"id":657272046,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4nLSzu","name":"latest.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":19075,"digest":"sha256:7738e148dbdc2dab17f244e511fd834212aee0fb0eeb3e34e105510bebd8bdc6","download_count":8680,"created_at":"2026-10-19T19:53:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T19:53:12Z"}],"body":"### 赞助信息\n\n- Jalapeno Cloud：GLM-5.3 限时 3 折（10 月 19 日至 25 日），Step 5 已上线，[活动入口](https://www.jalapeno-cloud.ai/DBX)\n\n### 新功能\n\n- 查询结果标签、结果集标签和结果区边框显示来源连接配置的颜色，便于区分测试与生产等不同环境的连接 (contributed by @CSXFanMeng) (PR [#10823](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10823))\n- SQL 编辑器补全支持按表和列的注释搜索，中文注释、拼音首字母和英文注释文本均可匹配 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12629](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12629))\n- 对象和数据库浏览器的紧凑卡片宽度可在 160、200、240 像素间选择（默认 160），两个浏览器共享该设置 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#12721](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12721))\n- SQL 补全列表支持 Ctrl-N/P 上下选择补全项 (contributed by @Xcylway) (PR [#12698](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12698))\n- 查询结果列宽按 SQL 文件记忆，手动调整的列宽跨会话和跨标签页保留 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12641](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12641))\n- 华为 DWS 连接支持查看 Estimated Plan 预估执行计划 (contributed by @0verme) (PR [#12644](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12644))\n- 数据传输新增目标列名转大写选项\n\n### 改进\n\n- 设置页语言选项的国旗图标改用内置 SVG 渲染，Windows 上不再依赖系统 emoji 字体，各平台显示一致 (contributed by @Ezreal-byte) (PR [#12715](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12715))\n- 深色主题下工作台内层面板改用不透明边框和更清晰的圆角，面板轮廓不再难以分辨 (contributed by @cseda-gullivernet) (PR [#12600](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12600))\n- 「跳转列」目标列表按用户调整后的列顺序显示，与网格和字段面板保持一致 (contributed by @hongshuo-wang) (PR [#11862](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11862))\n- MongoDB、Redis、etcd、ZooKeeper 等自带表单的连接类型补齐「保存密码」开关，取消勾选后密码不再写入本地密钥存储 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#12597](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12597))\n- Redis 连接 TLS 设置支持配置 CA 证书与客户端证书，可连接私有 CA 或启用双向认证的实例 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#12598](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12598))\n- 表格中选择自动刷新间隔后立即开始刷新，无需再单独点击开始自动刷新 (contributed by @Acd-kk) (PR [#12758](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12758))\n- 布尔值文本显示设置同时应用于单元格编辑下拉和详情面板，与网格显示保持一致 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#12626](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12626))\n- 「在数据库中查找」数据模式改为批量获取列并合并探测语句，显著减少跨进程往返；Oracle 家族 CLOB 列改用 DBMS_LOB 全量匹配，超长内容不再报 ORA-22835 (contributed by @Lan-zk) (PR [#12689](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12689))\n\n### 修复\n\n- 长按执行快捷键不再对同一标签页重复触发并发执行，执行计时和加载状态不再永久卡住 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12703](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12703))\n- 多语句查询按语句应用分页限制，并区分展示当前页 SQL 与实际执行 SQL (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#12684](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12684))\n- Web 端断线重连后保留插件侧边栏会话，文件和 SSH 操作不再报无活动连接 (contributed by @jinpy666) (PR [#12662](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12662))\n- PostgreSQL MERGE 语句格式化按子句边界换行，不再逐词一行 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#12595](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12595))\n- 快速开始页最近连接打开查询时带入连接默认 schema，未限定表名的查询不再报对象不存在 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#12596](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12596))\n- 中文输入法在表信息悬浮搜索框内组合输入时不再关闭悬浮窗、丢失已输入内容 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#12762](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12762))\n- 反引号、双引号、方括号包裹的 SQL 标识符按标识符着色，不再与字符串字面量同色 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12630](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12630))\n- SQL 语义分析的文本范围统一为包含式结尾列，诊断高亮不再多包含尾随的分隔符 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11779](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11779))\n- 手动统计总行数不再显示整表刷新遮罩，进度只在结果栏显示，统计期间表格仍可选中复制 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#12653](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12653))\n- Oracle 家族文本型 BLOB 复制为解码文本，与网格预览一致而不是十六进制 (contributed by @Tong-bit-art) (PR [#12679](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12679))\n- 无语句序号的批量删表结果按计划一一对应，单表删除成功后不再误报操作失败 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12685](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12685))\n- DB2 查询结果翻页改用游标分页，不支持 OFFSET 子句的旧版服务端不再报 SQLCODE -104 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#12764](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12764))\n- 触发器启用/禁用后侧边栏图标状态即时更新，手动刷新表不再丢失表级触发器 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12670](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12670))\n- 表级触发器分组刷新只加载当前表的触发器，Firebird 触发器支持启用/禁用和新建模板 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12664](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12664))\n- 关闭自动打开详情后点击其他对象，已打开的详情面板同步切换，不再停留在旧对象 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12697](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12697))\n- 侧边栏弹窗或内联重命名关闭后键盘焦点回到原位置，可继续键盘操作 (contributed by @Xcylway) (PR [#12699](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12699))\n- 未分组的横版标签保留用户显式配置的连接底色，连接颜色设置不再失去效果 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#12756](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12756))\n- 指针斜滑经过相邻菜单项时不再误切换或关闭已展开的二级菜单 (contributed by @hongshuo-wang) (PR [#12739](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12739))\n- 连接树底部显示端点行时插件快捷栏列表高度不再塌缩为标题行 (contributed by @yaoxinghuo) (PR [#12604](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12604))\n- 插件快捷入口位于连接树底部时，切换插件显示状态不再错误隐藏快捷栏 (contributed by @onenewcode) (PR [#12659](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12659))\n- openGauss 查看表索引修正兼容 SQL 的 JOIN 顺序，不再报 syntax error at or near \"LEFT\" (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12686](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12686))\n- GaussDB 索引查询保持 opclass JOIN 在 WHERE 之前，索引列表加载不再报语法错误 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#12690](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12690))\n- CockroachDB 刷新表列表时为 schema 占位符补充 ::text 转换，不再报 could not determine data type of placeholder\n- InfluxDB 1.x 查看测量结构改为展示只读描述，右键查看 DDL 不再失败\n- standalone Redis 大集合「加载更多」游标限定在本连接内，点击后不再报游标无效或无响应 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12648](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12648))\n- SQL Server、达梦 IDENTITY 自增列传输到 MySQL 家族目标保留 AUTO_INCREMENT，省略 id 的插入不再失败 (contributed by @Tong-bit-art) (PR [#11994](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11994))\n- Doris、StarRocks 目标按 BIGINT 门槛保留自增列并跳过同列 DEFAULT，建表不再被拒绝 (contributed by @Tong-bit-art) (PR [#12691](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12691))\n- MySQL auto_increment 源列传输到 Doris、StarRocks 不再生成不被支持的 INT AUTO_INCREMENT (contributed by @Tong-bit-art) (PR [#12713](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12713))\n- DATETIME 列传输到 Oracle、OceanBase Oracle 模式目标映射为 TIMESTAMP，建表不再报 OBE-00900/ORA-00902\n- SQL 导入允许 NOW()、CURRENT_TIMESTAMP 等无参时间表达式由数据库执行，预览阶段不再报不支持 (contributed by @Xcylway) (PR [#12688](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12688))\n\n---\n<!-- dbx-cnb-mirror -->\n> 国内下载：如果 GitHub 下载较慢，可从 [CNB 镜像](https://cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx/-/releases/tag/v0.6.49) 下载桌面端安装包，Docker 镜像从 `docker.cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx:v0.6.49` 拉取。\n","reactions":{"total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":17}
